OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'horrific' child
OL,4,Asex abuse plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who sought to arrange the sexual
OL,7,Fabuse of children has been jailed for
OL,8,Feight years.
OL,10,FRichard Stevenson's offending was
OL,11,Funcovered after he chatted online about
OL,12,Fhis detailed sexual abuse fantasies,
OL,13,Fraising how he wanted a "partner" to
OL,14,Fjoin him in acting out his wishes, and
OL,15,Fsharing videos containing child sexual
OL,16,Fabuse material, West Midlands Police
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FWhat Stevenson, of Coventry, did not
OL,20,Fknow was the person with whom he was
OL,21,Fcommunicating was an undercover police
OL,22,Fofficer.
